# The slim image's build context (deploy/peer.Dockerfile): avenDB's Cargo workspace, its manifests and every member's
# sources, nothing else. The same files make its tag (deploy/tag.mjs). This file replaces aven/DB2/.dockerignore, the
# box's, for this Dockerfile only. Every member in Cargo.toml needs its line here: tag.mjs refuses to run otherwise.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!codec
!core
!gen1
!db/docs
!db/engine
!store
!id/core
!peer/native
!peer/light
!peer/keeper
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.lake
**/runs
**/dist
**/deliverables
